#######################################
## THEME NAME: digitalRedux
## BY D Juarez  2024
## Hi everyone! I really like the digital theme but I'm also a sucker for large
## album art so I decided to edit the digital theme. I want to say ~70% of the
## code is original and the rest I added to implement additional things (such as
## the playlist position) and a typeface that supports Japanese. Hope y'all like
## it. This theme is intended to be simple so it will load fast. If you want to
## contact me make a post on the rockbox subreddit and I'll get in contact with
## you. Happy music listening! :)))))
## Disc working icon was taken from the xhibition theme and the icons were taken
## from adawaita. If y'all would rather me use different icons, then first of all
## apologies and secondly no problem my bad. I'll change it as soon as I can and
## upload it.
#######################################
